00:02:42.239 --> 00:02:48.920 align:start position:19%
means that we are dealing with 200
million time 1 Megabyte and we will be

00:02:46.159 --> 00:02:53.040 align:start position:19%
storing 20 petabytes of data each day
and some key takeaways that we can do

00:02:50.800 --> 00:02:57.400 align:start position:19%
from here is that this is clearly a read
heavy system meaning we should optimize

00:02:55.000 --> 00:03:02.080 align:start position:19%
for efficient reads and the data storage
requirements are very large so we need

00:02:59.319 --> 00:03:06.440 align:start position:19%
to consider scalable storage options and
also handling the load of popular users

00:03:04.440 --> 00:03:10.760 align:start position:19%
with millions of followers will present
a unique Challenge on its own and with

00:03:08.760 --> 00:03:14.480 align:start position:19%
this we can move on to the API design of
our system we'll assume that all

