and in the request we will have the
content which is the string text of the

00:03:41.560 --> 00:03:48.560 align:start position:19%
tweet it will contain media IDs which is
an array of media IDs for images and

00:03:46.599 --> 00:03:52.480 align:start position:19%
videos and from the server s we will
obtain this user ID which is received

00:03:50.599 --> 00:03:56.439 align:start position:19%
from the authentication Service and
we'll also receive the created ad or

00:03:54.400 --> 00:04:00.840 align:start position:19%
some sort of Tim stamp which is set by
