and in case of the successful response
we will include the ID of this created

00:04:02.879 --> 00:04:09.040 align:start position:19%
tweet we will also attach the Tim stamp
when the Tweet was created and also a

00:04:07.239 --> 00:04:13.159 align:start position:19%
